[statement]
Reduced from Alpine v3.23 (`main` and `community`, 2026-11-11), asked
for `plasma-mobile-meta`. `webkit2gtk-6.0`, reached through `bluedevil`,
`obexd` and `evolution-data-server`, needs
`dbus:org.freedesktop.Secrets`, which `gnome-keyring`, of priority 100,
and `kwallet` provide at no version; `plasma-workspace` needs `kwallet`
through `so:libKF6Wallet.so.6`. apk installs `kwallet` alone. Observed;
the secrets family of `reduced/kmail-takes-kwallet-alone`, in a shape
the rules that settled v3.24's do not reach.

